{
    "title": "Autograph: Sports Fandom",
    "description": "Get succinct daily morning summaries on game and team news with the Replay feature in the Autograph app. Sports news has never been easier to follow and stay up to date on.\r\n\r\nRead articles, listen to podcasts, access Fan Select no-fee tickets, curated team stores, all for free in our app. The best part? You get coins to level up and rank up your fandom for the things you\u2019re already doing. It\u2019s that simple.\r\n\r\nNow supporting over 275 teams across NFL, MLB, NBA, WNBA, NHL, NCAA Football & Basketball.\r\n\r\nHere\u2019s what you\u2019ll get (for free):\r\n\r\nALL THE BEST SPORTS COVERAGE IN ONE PLACE\r\n\u2022 REPLAY: Get succinct daily morning recaps on top game updates and news for the teams you follow\r\n\u2022 ROOMS: Chat rooms designed for sports fans \u2013\u00a0your sports group chats and team / creator communities in one place\r\n\u2022 Read articles from your favorite team\u2019s blogs and content creators directly in Autograph\r\n\u2022 Listen to the top sports podcasts\r\n\u2022 Exclusive content from top creators\r\n\u2022 Live scores including play-by-play notifications, plus schedules and historical data\r\n\u2022 Share your best social sports moments with other fans in FanZone \r\n\u2022 Refer friends and get rewarded together\r\n\r\nFAN SELECT TICKETING\r\n\u2022 Purchase tickets the easy and stress-free way\r\n\u2022 We curate the best sections in the top stadiums, arenas, and ballparks and pick the best tickets for the best prices\r\n\r\nCURATED MERCHANDISE\r\n\u2022 Shop curated selections of authentic team merchandise, collectibles, and gear\r\n\r\nEARN COINS, RANKINGS, AND STATUS\r\n\u2022 Earn coins for your daily acts of fandom - reading Replay summaries + blogs, listening to podcasts, watching videos and buying tickets / merchandise\r\n\u2022 Use coins to redeem for Autograph One rewards\r\n\u2022 Level up and increase your status within your fandom\r\n\u2022 See how you stack up with other fans of your team on Autograph team leaderboards\r\n\r\nUNLOCK REWARDS\r\n\u2022 Unlock the most flex-worthy rewards like tickets and merch, curated exclusively for you\r\n\u2022 True Fan Pricing\u2122 brings true fans unreal rewards like merch, tickets, and more for prices that you won\u2019t find anywhere else \r\n\u2022 Claim achievement trophies as you grow your fandom",
